  m_text: A diagnostic device designed to detect pregnancy through urine. It typically
    features a test strip or stick with a sample window and result display, which
    detects the presence of the hormone human chorionic gonadotropin (hCG) that is
    produced during pregnancy. These types of tests are highly accurate and can even
    detect pregnancy as early as the first day of a missed period. For the best accuracy,
    it is recommended to test with your first morning urine
